{{Quote|This is the largest weapons factory in the galaxy, one that runs nonstop, day and night. All fully automated.|[[Aggadeen]], the [[Overseer]] of Weapons Factory Alpha|<ref name="SW1">[[Star Wars (2015) 1|''Star Wars'' (2015) 1]]</ref>}}
A '''factory''' was a series of building and assembly areas used to mass produce or construct any number of things. [[Weapons Factory Alpha]] was the largest [[weapons factory]] the [[Galactic Empire]] utilized.<ref name="SW1" />

